!results/l12_renal/synthetic_cortec_draw*.csv
!results/l12_renal/synthetic_header_only_draw*.csv
# §6.2 surface parity: the third public draw of configuration C and the three Vertex AI draws
!results/nh_nmin0_cohortwise_d3/synthetic_cortec_draw0.csv
!results/nh_vertex_d0/synthetic_cortec_draw0.csv
!results/nh_vertex_d1/synthetic_cortec_draw*.csv
# §F.3's AIM comparison on the 12-column schema: AIM's five fits, CoRTeC's five draws, MST's and PATE-CTGAN's three
!results/credit_aim12/aim12_seed*.csv
